<title>SPAIN: Santander has stake in Argentaria.</title>
<headline>Santander has stake in Argentaria.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Santander has taken a small stake in Argentaria which is still 29.2 percent owned by the state, Santander chairman Emilio Botin was quoted as saying.</p>
<p>Botin, speaking in Chile, said the &quot;presence (of Santander in Argentaria) is not significant,&quot; according to a Santander spokesman.</p>
<p>The spokesman gave no details.</p>
<p>At 0945 GMT, Santander shares rose 40 pesetas to 4,750.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585 2159</p>
</text>
